==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Surge Base (Enemy Base)|Surge Base]].
*1 [[Mr. Puffington]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Big Sal]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*3 [[Mr. Puffington]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Big Sal]] spawns after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It is recommended to use "Research" Effect UP [[Cat Combo|Combos]] like [[Biohazard (Combo)|Biohazard]] and/or [[Bony Bone (Combo)|Bony Bone]] in order to [[:Category:Crowd-Controller-class Cats|crowd-control]] and [[:Category:Nuker-class Cats|nuke]] the Big Sals as much as possible.

Start the battle by waiting for the first Mr. Puffington to appear. When he does, start sending out only a maximum of '''THREE''' [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cats]] to stall him, but only send out one per attack. Wait for the second Mr. Puffington to appear, and stop spawning Manic Eraser Cats. Once the Mr. Puffingtons are on your base, you should have enough money to send out [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], so do that and resume spawning Manic Eraser Cats to defend him.

Awakened Bahamut Cat should chain and kill both Puffingtons and then die to the Surge Base. Another Mr. Puffington should appear at this time and the first Big Sal should be close to your base, so send out [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Green Shell Cat]] and start spamming [[Li'l Bird Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Flying Cats]] and/or [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCats]] along with [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Weedwacker Cats]]. Big Sal should be [[Freeze|frozen]] by the Weedwacker Cats and Green Shell Cats should be resilient enough to hold off Puffington for the time being, that Big Sal will soon die and your stack of [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|Anti-Zombie units]] and Green Shell Cat will die to Puffington.

Soon after, another Puffington should appear, so there should be two again. Send out another Green Shell Cat to stall both Puffingtons and then send out [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Awakened Mina]] to sync up both of them. Let both Puffingtons then kill Mina and Green Shell, resume the Awakened Bahamut steps mentioned previously. After that you are left with Big Sal, who you do the same Big Sal steps for again and then destroy the enemy base.

If you own [[Meditation Cat (Special Cat)|Paragon Cat]], this stage becomes much easier, as Big Sal is essentially out of commission for most of the level, letting you to focus on the Puffingtons and Surge Base instead.

==Trivia==
*This stage's name is a pun on the Cambodian temple complex [[wikipedia:Angkor Wat|Angkor Wat]].

